<title>CHINA: City Chiu Chow year net loss HK$1.98 mln.</title>
<headline>City Chiu Chow year net loss HK$1.98 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.0 loss  vs 4.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
